NEWS 0 - 4   Low:\\ 
Any single parameter score of 3 in only one category 
should not drive interventions alone or increase in VS frequency. 
Continue to monitor per VA medical facility's clinical algorithms. 
 
NEWS 5 - 6   Medium:\\
Patient at risk to deteriorate rapidly. Increase vital signs to every 2
hours for three times (next 6 hours total); reassess NEWS with each vital
sign set. Contact VA healthcare provider, site specific nursing resources,
and follow local VA medical facility's clinical algorithms.
 
NEWS 7 or greater   High:\\
Immediate action is needed. Notify charge RN and primary team immediately,
activation of Rapid Response Team (RRT), follow local VA medical
facility's clinical algorithms. Continuous monitoring is recommended.
